Access to the HSM should be controlled through Access Control Lists (ACLs); Separate ACLs should be maintained for each individual application to ensure application level isolation;
All access to HSM should be managed and monitored using a robust Privileged Identity and Access Management solution;
Decryption and validation of keys, PIN should be done at HSM;
Card PIN generation and printing should be directly at system connected HSM;
CVV generation and validation should be done at HSM;
Ensure HSM is implemented with secure PIN block format with controls to disable outputting PIN block in weaker format;
Secure key management for HSMs (such as LMKs, etc.); and
Security of the physical keys of the HSM device should be properly maintained.
